    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Like/Unlike Toggle\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Add `let liked = false;` at the top of your JS.\r\n2. Write a `render()` function that:\r\n\r\n   * Shows the filled heart when `liked` is true and the empty heart when `liked` is false.\r\n   * Updates the like count.\r\n3. In your button click event: flip `liked` and call `render()`.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
